<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to May 23.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name	     Price     pct change</p>
<p>1  Orogen Minerals  3.37	14.24</p>
<p>2  Rothmans	   9.10	10.30</p>
<p>3  CRA		 21.65	 6.08</p>
<p>4  CSL		  7.85	 6.08</p>
<p>5  Nat Aust Bank   18.79	 4.68</p>
<p>6  Oil Search	 2.93	 4.64</p>
<p>7  QBE Insurance    7.55	 4.50</p>
<p>8  Capral	     4.75	 4.40</p>
<p>9  David Jones	1.70	 4.29</p>
<p>10 QNI		  2.64	 3.94</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name	     Price     pct change</p>
<p>1  Centaur Mining   1.59	-5.92</p>
<p>2  Sons of Gwalia   5.45	-5.22</p>
<p>3  Fletcher Energy  4.01	-4.52</p>
<p>4  Lihir Gold	 2.26	-3.42</p>
<p>5  Futuris	    2.05	-3.30</p>
<p>6  Burswood	   1.47	-3.29</p>
<p>7  James Hardie     3.92	-3.21</p>
<p>8  Fletcher Build   3.46	-3.08</p>
<p>9  Great Cen Mines  2.52	-3.08</p>
<p>10 Rural Press	3.83	-3.04</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
